the emergency type. Tasks are then assigned to staff who are available nearby, so every action has an owner before anyone reaches the scene. The target is under three seconds from button press to a briefed team."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"className":"mb-5 max-w-[62ch] text-body last:mb-0","children":"If nobody acknowledges within 90 seconds, Gemini writes an escalation message and the duty manager is alerted automatically. Each resolved incident feeds an analytics pass in Vertex AI that surfaces hotspots and peak-risk times from the last 30 days."}]]}]}]]}],["$","div","2-Architecture",{"className":"grid-12 gap-y-6 border-t border-line py-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] first:border-t-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:sticky lg:top-28","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-meta text-muted","children":["(","03",")"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-[clamp(1.875rem,3.4vw,3rem)]","children":"Architecture"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","$L2d","pre-0,code-0",{"chart":"flowchart LR\n  P[Panic panel] --> A[FastAPI]\n  W[Guest web trigger] --> A\n  A --> F[(Firestore)]\n  A --> G[Gemini]\n  G --> A\n  A --> T[Task allocation]\n  T --> N[Push notifications]\n  A <--> D[Live dashboard]\n  F --> V[Vertex AI insights]"}]]}]}]]}],["$","div","3-Incident lifecycle",{"className":"grid-12 gap-y-6 border-t border-line py-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] first:border-t-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:sticky lg:top-28","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-meta text-muted","children":["(","04",")"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-[clamp(1.875rem,3.4vw,3rem)]","children":"Incident lifecycle"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-8","children":["$","div",n